  "provenance": "SYNTHETIC demonstration, not plant data. Single-stand four-high aluminium cold mill (work roll 0.40 m, backup roll 1.15 m, half-stack masses 3000/22000 kg, K_wb 4e10 N/m, K_h 1.4e10 N/m, 3 % modal damping, strip E 70 GPa, 4 m spans). Final pass 0.30 -> 0.21 mm, mean flow stress 270 MPa, friction 0.03, tensions 25/30 MPa, run at 16 m/s; schedule 2.2 -> 0.21 mm in six passes with flow stress 190/220/240/255/265/270 MPa, friction 0.08/0.07/0.06/0.05/0.04/0.03 and exit speed 3/5/7.5/10/13/16 m/s, chosen so every pass derives with max_radius_ratio 1.5 (final pass ratio about 1.46; friction 0.05 on the final pass is rejected at ratio about 1.66). Observations were GENERATED FROM THE MODEL ITSELF: pitch = u / dominant model frequency at 14.5 and 16 m/s (cells 256, beta 0.5), onset speed = model critical speed rounded, gauge variation detected, both faces, worse at thinner gauge. The case therefore tests the screening logic, not the physics.",
